---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Analytics Setup" description="How to connect Google Analytics 4 and Google Search Console to Rozgar Raasta Pakistan. No IDs exist yet — this is the setup guide.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">Analytics Setup</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Status: not connected. No analytics IDs exist and none have been invented.</p>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<h2>Google Analytics 4 (GA4)</h2>
			<ol>
				<li>Go to <a href="https://analytics.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">analytics.google.com</a> and sign in with the owner's Google account.</li>
				<li>Create a property named "Rozgar Raasta Pakistan".</li>
				<li>Choose "Web" and enter the live URL <code>https://rozgar-raasta-pakistan.vercel.app</code>.</li>
				<li>Copy the Measurement ID (it looks like <code>G-XXXXXXXXXX</code>).</li>
				<li>Add it to the site configuration and include the GA4 snippet in <code>src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro</code> inside <code>&lt;head&gt;</code>.</li>
				<li>Verify in GA4 Realtime that a visit to the live site is recorded.</li>
			</ol>
			<p><strong>Do not invent a Measurement ID.</strong> Until a real one is added, the admin dashboard honestly shows "Traffic — not connected".</p>
			<h2>Google Search Console</h2>
			<ol>
				<li>Go to <a href="https://search.google.com/search-console" target="_blank" rel="noopener">search.google.com/search-console</a> and sign in.</li>
				<li>Add the property <code>https://rozgar-raasta-pakistan.vercel.app</code> (URL prefix).</li>
				<li>Verify ownership using the HTML-tag method (add the verification meta tag to <code>BaseLayout.astro</code>) or the DNS method.</li>
				<li>Submit the sitemap: <code>https://rozgar-raasta-pakistan.vercel.app/sitemap-index.xml</code>.</li>
				<li>Request indexing for the homepage and main category pages.</li>
				<li>Monitor Search impressions, clicks and coverage issues weekly.</li>
			</ol>
			<h2>What we track (once connected)</h2>
			<p>Daily visitors, unique visitors, page views, traffic sources, top articles, search impressions and clicks, social referrals, returning visitors, engagement, and AdSense revenue (only after approval).</p>
			<h2>What we never do</h2>
			<p>Never fabricate traffic or earnings numbers. Never buy traffic or use bots.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
